  "details": "The gcc packages provide compilers for C, C++, Java, Fortran, Objective C, and Ada 95 GNU, as well as related support libraries.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gcc: Integer wrap in `std (CVE-2026-114691)\n  * gcc: Confirmed out-of-bounds read/write in libstdc++ parallel `std (CVE-2026-114690)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
